  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Cedar Community Learning Days"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "12 and 13 October 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Six practical sessions over two days"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Bring an idea you want to explain, plan or improve. Try a short activity, compare approaches with other…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Where we meet"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Cedar Community Room Main entrance and check-in location to be confirmed by the organizer."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Who can take part"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Adults who want to practise everyday planning and communication. No specialist software is required.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Plan your visit"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use the schedule on page 2 to choose sessions. Page 3 lists the practical details to check before…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Booking and contact details must be supplied by the organizer before this program is distributed. A…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Program at a glance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "All times are local. Each learning session lasts 45 minutes. The remaining time allows for questions…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Choose a pace that works for you"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "You may attend one session or several, subject to the booking arrangement. Take a break when needed.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If the schedule changes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The host will announce changes at check-in and provide the updated program through the confirmed…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Before you travel"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Confirm the venue and route"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The organizer must confirm the street address, arrival entrance, room and route from the entrance…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Ask about participation needs"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use the organizer contact on page 4 to discuss seating, hearing, reading, movement or another…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Bring a small example"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Bring a short note, draft or project idea that you are comfortable sharing. A pen and paper are enough.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Food and breaks"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Lunch is not specified in this example program. Confirm what is available before arriving and plan for…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If you need help on the day"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask the host at the confirmed check-in point. If a room, route or activity differs from the information…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Information I need before travelling:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "My visit and next step"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Sessions I plan to attend"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Session and time: ________________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Session and time: ________________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Session and time: ________________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One question to bring"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What would I like to try or understand?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "One next step to take away"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What will I do, and when will I try it?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Organizer contact"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Contact name: to be supplied Booking and questions: to be supplied On-the-day contact: to be supplied"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Program version 1 | Prepared 29 September 2026. Replace the unconfirmed contact and venue details…"
    }
  ],
